      "canvas_id": "https://lib.nus.edu.sg/sea_chinese/documents/Penang%20sin%20poe/1906/1906_08_08.pdf#page=3",
      "reading": "病原脉症",
      "status": "依原圖留讀",
      "reason": "原字从月、下為永，照脉。"
    },
    {
      "image": 1,
      "side": "single",
      "column": 5,
      "source_image_sha256": "8bfc01ab55224ef0e2893c9daea15897db5af76491af08029740180745878566",
      "canvas_id": "https://lib.nus.edu.sg/sea_chinese/documents/Penang%20sin%20poe/1906/1906_08_08.pdf#page=3",
      "reading": "遞寄香港東華醫院評定甲乙",
      "status": "依原圖留讀",
      "reason": "同欄寄字及院名、末段說法皆清楚，遞上有虍狀。"
    },
    {
      "image": 2,
      "side": "single",
      "column": 2,
      "source_image_sha256": "836cf5cb239a120c69d927f9da744694a2535789fc4d09f04b53928dea01bf06",
