      "reading": "四十七名已將各卷彙齊",
      "status": "依原圖留讀",
      "reason": "大寫字不同欄，彙上有彑，前後數字均明。"
    },
    {
      "image": 2,
      "side": "single",
      "column": 3,
      "source_image_sha256": "836cf5cb239a120c69d927f9da744694a2535789fc4d09f04b53928dea01bf06",
      "canvas_id": "https://lib.nus.edu.sg/sea_chinese/documents/Penang%20sin%20poe/1906/1906_09_20.pdf#page=3",
      "reading": "包封遞到粵省廣仁善堂",
      "status": "依原圖留讀",
      "reason": "另取較高的裁幅，首字包完整。遞的內部有虍/虎形；兩欄跳接保留實版位置。"
    },
    {
      "image": 2,
      "side": "single",
      "column": 3,
      "source_image_sha256": "836cf5cb239a120c69d927f9da744694a2535789fc4d09f04b53928dea01bf06",
      "canvas_id": "https://lib.nus.edu.sg/sea_chinese/documents/Penang%20sin%20poe/1906/1906_09_20.pdf#page=3",
      "reading": "評閱茲已評定甲乙",
      "status": "依原圖留讀",
      "reason": "原報同欄兩次從言的評，照錄。"
    },
    {
      "image": 2,
      "side": "single",
      "column": 4,
      "source_image_sha256": "836cf5cb239a120c69d927f9da744694a2535789fc4d09f04b53928dea01bf06",
      "canvas_id": "https://lib.nus.edu.sg/sea_chinese/documents/Penang%20sin%20poe/1906/1906_09_20.pdf#page=3",
      "reading": "尤者十名",
      "status": "依原圖留讀",
      "reason": "尤以一撇過字心，者在其下另占字位，非秀十。"
    },
    {
      "image": 2,
      "side": "single",
      "column": 4,
      "source_image_sha256": "836cf5cb239a120c69d927f9da744694a2535789fc4d09f04b53928dea01bf06",
